Werewolves
The Werewolves must eliminate the Townsfolk team to win. Each night, the Werewolves wake up together and decide on a player to kill by pointing at them. They cannot choose another Werewolf. If they do not agree, nobody is killed. There are also some Werewolf allies such as the Warlock and Foxes that work with the Werewolves, but do not know or wake with them. The Werewolves do not know who these allies are either, and may even accidentally kill them. These are all the basic Werewolf roles:
Werewolf
Wolf Cub
